// ⚠️ AN UNKNOWN NAME IS A NO-OP, NOT A FALLBACK. PoB's handler opens with
// `local bossData = data.bossSkills[val]` and immediately reads `bossData.earlierUber`
// (ConfigOptions.lua:1639-1641), so a name absent from this map errors before a single
// placeholder is touched and the build loads with every enemy placeholder untouched. 3.20
// renamed "Uber Atziri Flameblast" to "Atziri Flameblast"; corpus builds still saving the old
// name must therefore change nothing.
//
// ⚠️ THE UBER FIELDS ARE DEAD ON THE GRADED ARTIFACT and are carried anyway, because the table
// is a transcription of PoB's rather than of what we happen to read. `isUber` is derived from
// the enemyIsBoss DROPDOWN's selIndex (:1640-1643) and ConfigTab:Load calls BuildModList (:332)
// BEFORE UpdateControls/SelByValue (:333), so the control still sits on defaultIndex = 1
// ("None") while the handler runs. See applyPresetBossSkills for the measurement.

